[statement]
A candidate whose dependency cannot be met is passed over where it also
depends on the package that requires it: `c` needs `e`, `e` 2 needs `c`
and `a`, which nothing provides, and apk installs `e` 1. Without the
dependency on `c`, apk refuses
(`refusals/a-candidate-whose-dependency-cannot-be-met-is-not-passed-over`)
.

[repository]
P:c
V:3
D:e

P:e
V:2
D:c a

P:e
V:1

[request]
c

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install e 1
install c 3
